&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy, part of WPP, has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity – innovating at the intersections of its advertising, public relations, relationship design, consulting, and health capabilities with experts collaborating seamlessly across over 120 offices in nearly 90 countries. Ogilvy currently &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-rankings-third-straight-year&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt; as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is a WPP company (NYSE: WPP). For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31Se_7mxpVA$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/twitter.com/ogilvy__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31SccaJbNMQ$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.instagram.com/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31SfRZhifmA$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.facebook.com/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31ScfS6rLGg$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Account Director&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Consumer PR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department: &lt;/strong&gt;Consumer PR &amp;amp; Influence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Fixed-Term 12-Months&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Time/Part time:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting into: &lt;/strong&gt;Business Director / Client Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a talented individual to join our team as an Account Director on a large technology account. You’ll spearhead high-impact PR campaigns and run a fast-paced press office that spans both consumer and corporate remits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a natural problem solver who thrives on challenge and builds instinctive, collaborative relationships across different agency Capabilities and Crafts. Combining a deep understanding of strategy with flawless execution, you will ensure the team constantly delivers creative, quality work that moves the needle for our client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years’ of PR experience, ideally with a “corpsumer” background&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in consumer tech and the evolving world of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the UK media landscape and established journalist relationships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of managing fast-paced press offices and navigating complex, multi-stakeholder projects spanning consumer, corporate and policy remits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established as a trusted advisor to mid-level clients, with a strong grasp of their business context, challenges and goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural problem-solver who looks at briefs from unexpected angles and pushes for innovative ways to sell in and execute work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes ownership of large projects and is accountable for both work and process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An empowering mentor who guides junior team members, manages up effectively, and fosters a collaborative team culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially astute, with experience managing budgets, scoping work, and resource planning to hit targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with clients, becoming a trusted partner and advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage the fast-paced press office function, and projects across consumer, corporate and policy remits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end delivery of projects, from briefing, scoping and resourcing to execution and measurement, working with other Capabilities and Crafts instinctively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders, including media, creators and internal client teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a team of Account Managers and Account Executives, providing guidance and mentorship, while also acting as an escalation point to support the team in resolving issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with integrated teams across Ogilvy, including social media and influencer marketing, to spot opportunities and align on campaigns and projects, where relevant&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of creativity, collaboration, and innovation within the agency and among the account management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main point of contact for mid-senior clients, managing communication and expectations throughout the project lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all campaign materials, including press releases and assets, are delivered to a high standard and align with the client&#39;s messaging and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regular client meetings and status updates to review project progress and discuss any changes or adjustments needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement measurement strategies, as required, to evaluate campaign effectiveness and report on ROI to clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, balancing competing priorities and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion inclusiveness, diversity, and equity in all aspects of work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of industry trends, ensuring a relevant and fresh approach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we help you Thrive:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt; 25 days annual leave + 1 Volunteer Day &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa Healthcare&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Maternity, Adoption and Shared Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a Flexible Working Model with core working hours: 10am – 4pm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1.5:1 Matching Pension Structure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing and Health: Up to £25.00 per month towards physical or online exercise class membership, Unmind membership, LifeWorks tool and annual eye tests and development budgets and Wellbeing incentives and activities throughout the year &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loan and Cycle to Work Scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director of Operations&lt;/strong&gt; to own the systems, structure, and governance that allow our supply chain and fulfilment operation to scale reliably as we grow into a more complex, multi-brand business under the Hims &amp;amp; Hers umbrella.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership role sitting at the intersection of operations, supply chain, commercial delivery, and cross-functional execution. You will be responsible for making sure the operation works - not just today, but as we transition to the Hims &amp;amp; Hers brand, treat more conditions, and grow order volumes over the next few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the VP of Operations Assurance at Hims &amp;amp; Hers, leading a small but growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and own the annual supply chain strategy, OKRs, and volume forecasting, translating growth plans into resource, capex, and headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Procurement:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage end-to-end demand and supply planning, pharmaceutical and vendor relationships, and procurement governance across Rx and non-Rx categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Order Management and Order Life Cycle: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage Prescribe to Pharmacy process while executing exceptions and meeting appropriate SLA’s.&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Patient Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Own courier strategy, carrier SLA management, and the delivery experience function as a retention lever.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost &amp;amp; COGS:&lt;/strong&gt; Own fulfilment cost per order and shipping targets, identifying and delivering initiatives to reduce COGS and wastage across the operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fulfilment Engineering &amp;amp; Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the roadmap for fulfilment systems (PMR, WMS, ERP) across our pharmacy and warehouse operations, partnering with engineering to deliver and govern them reliably at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Control: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage IC related responsibilities including day to day but also month and quarter close while ensuring appropriate accounting and compliance measures to meet accuracy commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Launches:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead supply chain input into new product and brand launches, coordinating across Commercial, Clinical, and Growth as we expand under Hims &amp;amp; Hers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Org Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and grow a small team from day one, hiring key roles and building a high-accountability culture as the operation scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an experienced operations leader who thrives in high-growth environments where the pace is fast and the problems are genuinely complex. You know how to build structure without creating bureaucracy, and how to hold a high bar on execution without slowing the business down.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are as comfortable in the weeds of a supply chain model or a fulfilment systems conversation as you are presenting a strategy to senior stakeholders. You are commercially sharp, operationally rigorous, and a natural cross-functional partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are excited by the challenge of scaling an operation that is already moving quickly - bringing the systems, governance, and team capability needed to support a more complex, multi-brand business as Eucalyptus grows within the Hims &amp;amp; Hers portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8–12 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in supply chain, operations, or a related function, with at least 3–4 years in a director or head-of level role with a team behind you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of owning end-to-end supply chain or fulfilment operations at scale - ideally in a high-growth, high-volume environment (e.g. e-commerce, health, consumer goods, mobility)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and manage supplier and vendor relationships across complex, multi-category supply chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen - able to own COGS targets, model cost initiatives, and communicate financial impact clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with product and engineering teams to define and deliver fulfilment system requirements &amp;amp; transformations (e.g. WMS, ERP, order management)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional product and category launches from an operations perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership skills - able to hire, develop, and performance manage a growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management - confident presenting to exec and SLT-level audiences and partnering across commercial, clinical, and finance functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in London, with willingness to travel to Birmingham &amp;amp; Enfield on a regular basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.compound.co/&quot;&gt;Compound&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, skincare, and preventative health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
