&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1414&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5c95ea08f36&quot;&gt;Excellent project management and delivery skills with the ability to break down ambiguous initiatives into executable plans&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1541&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2cf9fe8ead60&quot;&gt;Ability to identify critical paths, manage complex dependency graphs, and coordinate multiple parallel workstreams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1659&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a565c22991c&quot;&gt;Strong risk management and prioritisation skills, with the ability to make progress in fast-changing environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
